            "title": "國際｜肯德基特許經營商Tasty Chick'n申破產保護 擬出售84間門店",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"國際｜肯德基特許經營商Tasty Chick'n申破產保護 擬出售84間門店\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"503\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/aeb8f342b08a1766c3024e92cbba99db103fc203a5ec69ba75fdbc91feb2d9f9/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fvi%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png_up.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">國際｜肯德基特許經營商Tasty Chick'n申破產保護 擬出售84間門店</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">美國肯德基特許經營商Tasty Chick'n於11月16日向德州南區聯邦破產法院申請第11章破產保護，背負約7,300萬美元有息債務，並計劃出售旗下84間門店。公司銷售額連續三個財政年度下滑，餐廳層面EBITDA由1,240萬美元降至約710萬美元。肯德基與Taco Bell指其拖欠約1,570萬美元特許權費及相關費用，並已通知擬終止特許經營協議。</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B-%E8%82%AF%E5%BE%B7%E5%9F%BA%E7%89%B9%E8%A8%B1%E7%B6%93%E7%87%9F%E5%95%86tasty-chickn%E7%94%B3%E7%A0%B4%E7%94%A2%E4%BF%9D%E8%AD%B7-%E6%93%AC%E5%87%BA%E5%94%AE84%E9%96%93%E9%96%80%E5%BA%97-133053166.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-20 21:41:40",
